{"id":"9e926c452321080c","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gls-completeness.md","title":"GLS Arithmetical Truth Completeness","display":"thm-gls-completeness — GLS Arithmetical Truth Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gls-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-gls-completeness"],"display":"thm-gls-completeness — GLS Arithmetical Truth Completeness","depends_on":["[[89-df-gls-logic]]","[[89-df-always-true-modal]]","[[89-df-reflection-companion]]","[[89-lem-solovay-truth]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gls-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gls-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gls-completeness — GLS Arithmetical Truth Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da4d48b529c5f7d2\" href=\"?note=da4d48b529c5f7d2\" title=\"89-df-gls-logic\">89-df-gls-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a177f4739c6be55\" href=\"?note=9a177f4739c6be55\" title=\"89-df-always-true-modal\">89-df-always-true-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea2ed81f5a3df51c\" href=\"?note=ea2ed81f5a3df51c\" title=\"89-df-reflection-companion\">89-df-reflection-companion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e36ef17b6856ad1\" href=\"?note=1e36ef17b6856ad1\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-truth\">89-lem-solovay-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLS}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLS}\\)</span> 为两个定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为全部实现下真集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^s\">\\(A^s\\)</span> 为有限反射伴随式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gls\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLS}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A^s\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gls\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLS}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A^s\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 131–132；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书的 GLS 算术完全性定理。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^s\">\\(A^s\\)</span> 属 GL，GLS 中每个反射前提成立，以 MP 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 属 GLS，其翻译在标准模型中保真。对剩下的逆向，原书以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^s\">\\(A^s\\)</span> 的有限反模型作自指反解释，使用该反模型中成立的有限反射前提，把新增根的外部真值与原根的子公式归纳联系起来，得到使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 假的实现。这里引用原书该逆向完整论证；新增根 0 的忠实性不能从只限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge1\">\\(i\\ge1\\)</span> 的真值引理直接套得。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gls-logic","status":"resolved","id":"da4d48b529c5f7d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gls-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-always-true-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9a177f4739c6be55","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-always-true-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-companion","status":"resolved","id":"ea2ed81f5a3df51c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-companion]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-solovay-truth","status":"resolved","id":"1e36ef17b6856ad1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"A^s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gls\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLS}\n&\\Longleftrightarrow A^s\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A^s","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^s","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ge1","display":false}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":